<title>JAPAN: Japan end-April kerosene stocks up 50.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan end-April kerosene stocks up 50.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's kerosene stockpile stood at 2.74 million kilolitres (kl) as of end-April, up 50.5 percent from a year earlier and up 13.2 percent from a month earlier, the trade ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Demand for kerosene, used for heating, peaks in Japan during the four-month period from November to February.</p>
</text>
